  "body": "<h1>NBA DFS Rankings for Friday, November 13 (DraftKings)</h1>\n<p class=\"meta\">DraftKings main slate · <strong>Friday, November 13</strong> · 6 games · First game 7:00 PM ET · By <strong>Chris Spags</strong> · <!--@@SLATE-PUBLISHED@@--> · Numbers as of <time datetime=\"2026-11-13T19:51:16-05:00\">November 13, 7:51 PM ET</time></p>\n<p>Giannis Antetokounmpo (MIA) ranks first on the Friday, November 13 DraftKings main slate at 57.4 projected DraftKings points for $11,500. Jalen Johnson (ATL, 51.5) and Alperen Sengun (HOU, 47.5) are next.</p>\n<p>The table ranks the top 100 of 130 players in the run by SPAGS projection, with DraftKings salary and projected points per $1,000.</p>\n<p>Every projection is a SPAGS model estimate from the November 13, 7:51 PM ET run of the Splash Play NBA model. This page updates each time the main-slate numbers are run, and NBA projections move with every injury report, so check the time above before you build.</p>\n<!-- SLOT:OFFER-TOP -->\n<!--@@SLATE-OFFER@@-->\n<style>@media(max-width:480px){.tw.nb th,.tw.nb td{padding-left:5px!important;padding-right:5px!important}.tw.nb th:first-child,.tw.nb td:first-child{padding-left:9px!important}}</style>\n<h2>DraftKings rankings by projection, Nov 13</h2>\n<div class=\"tw nb\"><table><thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Player</th><th>Salary</th><th>SPAGS proj</th><th>Pts/$1K</th><th>Pos</th><th>Team</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>1</td><td><a href=\"/dfs/nba/players/giannis-antetokounmpo/\">Giannis Antetokounmpo</a></td><td>$11,500</td><td class=\"num\">57.4</td><td class=\"num\">4.99</td><td>PF</td><td>MIA</td></tr>\n<tr><td>2</td><td><a href=\"/dfs/nba/players/jalen-johnson/\">Jalen Johnson</a></td><td>$9,300</td><td class=\"num\">51.5</td><td class=\"num\">5.54</td><td>PF</td><td>ATL</td></tr>\n<tr><td>3</td><td><a href=\"/dfs/nba/players/alperen-sengun/\">Alperen Sengun</a></td><td>$9,400</td><td class=\"num\">47.5</td><td class=\"num\">5.05</td><td>PF/C</td><td>HOU</td></tr>\n<tr><td>4